### ✅ CEK SERVER AKTIF
GET http://localhost:3000/

### ✅ LIHAT SEMUA DATA MESIN
GET http://localhost:3000/mesin-data

### ✅ LIHAT DATA RIWAYAT PERPINDAHAN
GET http://localhost:3000/riwayat-data

### ✅ LIHAT JUMLAH MESIN BERPINDAH HARI INI
GET http://localhost:3000/count


### 🆕 TAMBAH MESIN BARU
POST http://localhost:3000/add-mesin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "merk_mesin": "Merk5",
  "nomer_seri_mesin": "SN005",
  "line_sekarang": "2A",
  "kode_barcode": "BC005"
}


### 🔄 PINDAHKAN MESIN (UPDATE)
POST http://localhost:3000/update
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id_mesin": 36,
  "line_baru": "1A"
}

### 🔄 PINDAHKAN MESIN LAIN (COBA TEST)
POST http://localhost:3000/update
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id_mesin": 2,
  "line_baru": "5B"
}
